WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.360
EPISODE 12

01:41.880 --> 01:44.400
My lady, here's the sweet
wheat cake you wanted.

01:44.480 --> 01:45.600
I searched all over the city.

01:45.680 --> 01:48.280
I finally found it
by the Four Kings Temple.

01:49.600 --> 01:52.160
Earlier today, our mother saw
Mr. Du walking into Pan Restaurant,

01:52.240 --> 01:53.960
just steps behind you.

01:54.520 --> 01:56.320
You're not planning a rebellion, are you?

01:57.320 --> 01:59.200
Rebel against whom?

01:59.280 --> 02:02.080
I wouldn't dare go against you, my lady!

02:03.480 --> 02:05.320
My lady, look!

02:05.400 --> 02:08.800
I am afraid that it would get cold,
so I kept it close to my chest.

02:08.880 --> 02:10.520
It's burned me!

02:10.600 --> 02:13.480
My sincerity is evident.
Even Heaven can vouch for me!

02:15.320 --> 02:17.000
Still not telling the truth?

02:17.080 --> 02:19.800
Careful, my lady.
Don't let your anger harm the baby.

02:20.400 --> 02:22.280
They forced me, I swear!

02:24.800 --> 02:25.720
My lady!

02:35.720 --> 02:36.600
My lady!

02:37.960 --> 02:40.200
I share a secret with you.

02:40.280 --> 02:41.600
How will you thank me?

02:41.680 --> 02:43.760
I don't care for your secret.

02:46.920 --> 02:50.760
But this concerns Shouhua's reputation
and the honor of the Li family.

02:50.840 --> 02:51.840
You don't want to know.

03:13.560 --> 03:15.120
- Really?
- Absolutely true.

03:18.080 --> 03:19.400
Outrageous!

03:23.920 --> 03:24.880
- Shouhua!
- What happened?

03:24.960 --> 03:26.200
Such a hurry to call me back.

03:26.800 --> 03:29.080
Stay outside and don't let anyone in.

03:40.240 --> 03:41.400
Understood.

03:41.480 --> 03:42.760
You two should leave now.

03:43.760 --> 03:46.840
Shouhua, this matter is no trivial thing.
It demands the utmost care.

03:47.760 --> 03:51.280
Shouhua,
do you really know that man named Yan?

03:53.040 --> 03:57.280
Kangning, my conscience is clear.
I have nothing to hide.

03:57.360 --> 03:59.040
Let him investigate.
What do I have to fear?

03:59.840 --> 04:03.440
I appreciate your concern,
but Grandmother can't see,

04:03.520 --> 04:05.120
and she needs someone by her side.

04:05.720 --> 04:08.080
If there's nothing else,
I'll take my leave.

04:12.040 --> 04:13.360
Shouhua!

04:19.960 --> 04:21.400
She speaks with such confidence.

04:21.480 --> 04:24.000
She must have a plan.
Don't lose your composure.

04:27.880 --> 04:31.160
GOLD AND SILVER

04:39.880 --> 04:41.440
GOLD AND SILVER

04:44.040 --> 04:45.720
- Bring it over carefully!
- Got it.

04:51.720 --> 04:52.920
Make way!

05:06.480 --> 05:09.400
Sir, are you looking for some water?
I have some.

05:10.000 --> 05:11.120
Come on in. Follow me.

05:21.320 --> 05:23.280
Oh, no trouble at all, Shouhua.

05:23.360 --> 05:24.800
It's cheaper to buy it on the street.

05:24.880 --> 05:27.360
Madam prefers freshly ground ones herself.

05:27.440 --> 05:29.280
It tastes better
than the diluted stuff outside.

05:30.960 --> 05:33.000
- Let me help.
- No need.

05:43.320 --> 05:45.840
- Wow, you're amazing!
- Great.

05:45.920 --> 05:47.480
Higher, higher!

05:47.560 --> 05:49.280
Higher still!

05:49.960 --> 05:52.320
This is so cool!

05:55.600 --> 05:57.560
Higher, higher!

06:03.360 --> 06:05.320
She is flying now!

06:07.200 --> 06:08.600
So beautiful!

06:18.920 --> 06:19.960
Let's go!

06:32.520 --> 06:33.360
Shouhua,

06:35.200 --> 06:37.160
it's spilling over!

06:43.000 --> 06:44.320
I'll go get the door.

06:48.280 --> 06:49.560
Coming!

06:52.960 --> 06:53.800
You're finally here!

06:53.880 --> 06:55.680
She has been waiting for you.

06:59.280 --> 07:00.960
My lady, greetings and best wishes.

07:01.040 --> 07:03.160
The Liu family, who sell
medicine on Guozi Street,

07:03.240 --> 07:05.000
are looking for a maidservant.

07:05.600 --> 07:07.840
Their lady is unbelievably picky.

07:07.920 --> 07:10.360
Running errands for them
has made my legs as thin as a donkey's!

07:10.960 --> 07:13.320
Ms. Yang,
is it your legs that have thinned

07:13.400 --> 07:14.480
or the donkey's?

07:15.080 --> 07:16.080
Chunlai!

07:16.160 --> 07:18.600
Stop teasing me. Both the donkey's legs

07:18.680 --> 07:20.320
and mine have gotten thinner!

07:20.920 --> 07:22.640
Ms. Yang, come inside to talk.

07:38.400 --> 07:39.640
No rush.

07:39.720 --> 07:41.800
I've already informed
the Chai and Fan families.

07:41.880 --> 07:43.440
No bag is airtight, and news will leak.

07:43.520 --> 07:45.600
No rush, no rush.

07:50.080 --> 07:51.120
My lady!

07:52.680 --> 07:55.160
Sir, you're back! Have you eaten?

07:55.240 --> 07:58.680
Yes, I have.
How is your nighttime coughing, my lady?

07:59.480 --> 08:01.840
I'm taking medicine and coughing less.

08:01.920 --> 08:02.880
Thank you for asking.

08:05.240 --> 08:06.240
My lady,

08:06.840 --> 08:08.520
are we having any guests at home lately?

08:10.240 --> 08:13.240
Back when we first came to the capital,
I only brought two servants.

08:13.320 --> 08:17.320
Ms. Liu often helps out at the shop.
Chunlai served Mother for a long time.

08:18.000 --> 08:19.800
Let her help out at the Du's
for a few days.

08:19.880 --> 08:24.000
Once the middleman finds a kitchen maid,
we can send her back early.

08:26.720 --> 08:28.880
Those middlemen roaming the streets,

08:28.960 --> 08:30.840
talking slick and sharp,
swindle money, and even

08:31.520 --> 08:33.560
sell children and women.

08:33.640 --> 08:34.640
They're truly despicable.

08:35.480 --> 08:38.760
My lady, you must be extra cautious
about who enters the house.

08:39.480 --> 08:40.800
I understand.

08:41.880 --> 08:43.120
Thank you for your concern.

08:49.920 --> 08:51.320
Three days have passed.

08:51.400 --> 08:54.600
If you truly cared,
you should've told me earlier.

08:54.680 --> 08:55.560
Don't tell me you…

09:00.320 --> 09:01.360
No, no, absolutely not!

09:02.280 --> 09:05.120
It must be that scoundrel
pestering you, my lady.

09:05.200 --> 09:06.960
That's why you couldn't tell me, isn't it?

09:08.120 --> 09:09.120
Yes, yes, exactly.

09:12.440 --> 09:13.600
Calm down.

09:30.480 --> 09:31.760
The shopkeeper said that

09:31.840 --> 09:34.960
Mr. Yan bought a pair of bracelets
meant for a young lady.

09:35.040 --> 09:35.880
Bracelets!

09:56.880 --> 09:58.920
JINSI HALL

09:59.000 --> 09:59.840
Lingyao!

09:59.920 --> 10:03.080
Sir, sir!
That middleman, Ms. Yang, is here again!

10:03.680 --> 10:04.640
- Yuanming!
- She…

10:04.720 --> 10:05.880
- Don't say it.
- Yuanming!

10:07.640 --> 10:08.480
Yuanming!

10:09.520 --> 10:11.000
Look at this thank-you note.

10:11.080 --> 10:13.480
To serve with sincerity and honor,
never straying from my resolve,

10:13.560 --> 10:16.440
or sacrificing oneself for the country,
upholding loyalty until the end.

10:16.520 --> 10:17.720
Which one sounds better?

10:18.360 --> 10:19.440
I think both are good.

10:19.520 --> 10:22.280
You decide among yourselves.
I have something to attend to. Excuse me.

10:22.960 --> 10:25.280
- Lingyao.
- Yuanming, Yuanming!

10:25.880 --> 10:29.040
Chamberlain Wang will be here soon.
Where are you off to now?

10:29.760 --> 10:30.600
Yuanming!

10:36.880 --> 10:38.600
Ms. Yang, take care!

10:38.680 --> 10:39.760
Miss, you should go back.

10:43.880 --> 10:44.800
Stop!

10:46.480 --> 10:47.320
Come here.

10:48.200 --> 10:50.840
Ms. Yang,
why do you run every time you see me?

10:50.920 --> 10:55.800
My poor, failing old eyes
couldn't recognize you.

10:56.440 --> 10:58.080
I heard someone calling behind me

10:58.160 --> 11:03.120
and thought it was Lady Cui next door
coming to collect a debt for her horse.

11:03.840 --> 11:05.760
It scared me half to death.

11:05.840 --> 11:08.320
I've been here many times

11:08.400 --> 11:10.480
but never had the honor
of meeting you before.

11:11.280 --> 11:13.000
You're home early today!

11:13.080 --> 11:16.760
Ms. Yang,
did you find the person I asked for?

11:16.840 --> 11:17.680
I've found her!

11:17.760 --> 11:20.520
She's a maid from the family
of Master Cao, the jewelry merchant.

11:20.600 --> 11:23.280
She's as strong as an ox
and quick with her hands.

11:23.360 --> 11:24.560
Perfect for kitchen work.

11:24.640 --> 11:25.720
It's all set.

11:25.800 --> 11:28.200
I'll bring her over at noon
for my lady to see.

11:28.280 --> 11:30.600
I was just about to visit
the Cao family to inform them.

11:31.200 --> 11:33.880
Please, let go of me!
I'll head to the Cao family now.

11:34.840 --> 11:36.400
What's this?

11:38.160 --> 11:39.240
Sir.

11:44.680 --> 11:46.880
I have no heart for makeup and rouge,

11:46.960 --> 11:49.280
only to find the gold bracelet
loose on my thin wrist.

11:49.360 --> 11:51.360
After we parted, I grew more haggard,

11:51.440 --> 11:54.520
my longing deeper
than words could describe.

11:54.600 --> 11:58.640
This is clearly a woman's poem,
missing her lover.

12:00.960 --> 12:03.640
The gold bracelet loose on my thin wrist.

12:05.400 --> 12:07.280
Gold bracelet.

12:14.160 --> 12:15.840
Oh, what a gold bracelet!

12:18.360 --> 12:19.480
Mr. Du, give it back to me!

12:19.560 --> 12:21.240
- Mr. Du!
- Let go!

12:21.960 --> 12:23.960
Mr. Du, Mr. Du!

12:28.520 --> 12:29.480
Sir, you're back!

12:29.560 --> 12:31.160
Guard the east wing.

12:31.240 --> 12:32.840
- Don't disturb my mother.
- Understood.

12:45.440 --> 12:46.280
Sir, you're here.

12:48.760 --> 12:50.320
What have you done!

12:59.960 --> 13:00.880
What happened?

13:05.360 --> 13:08.800
Well… My lady found the things
in the main hall old and worn.

13:09.280 --> 13:11.120
She had some items brought
from her family home.

13:11.200 --> 13:14.840
But the movers were
careless and broke a vase.

13:15.440 --> 13:16.680
That doesn't sound quite right.

13:17.520 --> 13:18.880
Who would dare deceive you?

13:18.960 --> 13:22.000
Everyone, be careful not
to bump into anything else!

13:23.040 --> 13:25.280
Here, old madam, let me help you inside.

13:31.560 --> 13:33.240
The Li family has pushed me this far.

13:33.320 --> 13:35.200
This is intolerable!

13:36.240 --> 13:38.280
Today, I will divorce my wife!

13:44.960 --> 13:47.200
What happened to his wife?
Everything seemed fine, so why…

13:55.600 --> 13:58.680
- Oh no, oh no!
- What now?

13:58.760 --> 14:00.440
Mr. Du is going to divorce his wife!

14:04.960 --> 14:05.800
Mother!

14:07.280 --> 14:08.400
This, uh… This…

14:10.040 --> 14:12.040
- This, this…
- No, this won't do, Mother!

14:14.720 --> 14:16.560
- How dare he bully my daughter!
- Mother! Mother!

14:17.160 --> 14:18.760
- This will work well.
- You!

14:23.080 --> 14:26.400
If he dares lay a finger on my daughter,
I'll flatten his family grave!

14:26.480 --> 14:29.280
Mother, don't listen to that.
She just wants to stir up trouble!

14:29.360 --> 14:31.040
Mr. Du is about
to be appointed to a position.

14:31.120 --> 14:33.240
Assaulting a government official
is a serious crime.

14:33.320 --> 14:34.920
I'm his mother-in-law!

14:35.000 --> 14:37.880
If you go through with it,
by tomorrow, you won't be anymore.

14:41.200 --> 14:42.640
You have a point.

14:43.920 --> 14:45.320
Let's think of another way.

14:46.480 --> 14:48.080
Why are you giving me this? Take it away.

14:49.200 --> 14:51.000
Having scruples is no fun.

14:51.080 --> 14:51.920
This is lame.

14:52.600 --> 14:53.680
Let's go.

14:58.000 --> 15:00.440
Though Mr. Du
is an arrogant and aloof man,

15:00.520 --> 15:01.840
he wouldn't act without a plan.

15:01.920 --> 15:03.920
When he passed the imperial exam,
he asked for a divorce

15:04.000 --> 15:05.760
from the daughter of his benefactor.

15:05.840 --> 15:08.440
Even if he doesn't fear being scorned
as an ungrateful scoundrel,

15:08.520 --> 15:10.640
the court censors' brushes
won't spare him either.

15:11.560 --> 15:13.000
He hasn't even received his post yet.

15:13.600 --> 15:14.880
This makes no sense at all.

15:15.600 --> 15:17.400
What on earth is the reason
for this divorce?

15:17.480 --> 15:18.960
Shouhua, just tell us!

15:19.920 --> 15:24.360
He lashed out at me without cause
and called me a fickle woman.

15:24.440 --> 15:25.560
But for what reason?

15:26.240 --> 15:29.240
In all heaven and earth,
only he himself knew it.

15:29.320 --> 15:31.320
I haven't committed any
of the Seven Grounds for Divorce.

15:31.400 --> 15:32.520
There's no reason for this.

15:32.600 --> 15:34.000
Tell him this.

15:34.480 --> 15:36.760
If he can't divorce me,
we'll have to settle for separation.

15:37.840 --> 15:40.480
Go find my brother-in-law
and question him thoroughly.

15:42.720 --> 15:44.440
There's no need to say more.

15:44.520 --> 15:47.480
You saved my life that day, and your
kindness weighs as heavily as Mount Tai.

15:48.160 --> 15:51.320
I will never forget it.
I'll repay this debt in the future.

15:52.160 --> 15:55.040
As for today's rash offense,
I beg for your forgiveness.

15:55.120 --> 15:57.000
The divorce letter
will be delivered another day.

15:58.040 --> 15:59.200
For now, I must take my leave.

16:02.880 --> 16:05.400
Come out, come out!
Quickly, stop your brother-in-law!

16:07.000 --> 16:09.840
Yangxi,
weren't you here to take Shouhua back?

16:09.920 --> 16:11.480
Why are you leaving by yourself?

16:17.760 --> 16:20.040
She won't say anything,
and you refuse to explain.

16:20.120 --> 16:22.120
How can anyone die like this,
not knowing the cause?

16:22.200 --> 16:25.640
Which of the Seven Grounds was violated
to justify this divorce?

16:26.360 --> 16:27.880
Without a clear reason,

16:27.960 --> 16:30.240
my family won't dare
accept the divorce letter.

16:30.960 --> 16:32.000
Brother-in-law!

16:32.080 --> 16:35.000
Newlyweds arguing is perfectly normal.

16:35.080 --> 16:36.720
Why escalate it
to the point of separation?

16:36.800 --> 16:38.400
It'll only invite ridicule.

16:38.480 --> 16:40.040
You're about to take office.

16:40.120 --> 16:42.160
Surely, you should act
with magnanimity and kindness.

16:42.960 --> 16:46.520
Even if Shouhua made a mistake,
for the sake of Mother and us,

16:46.600 --> 16:48.320
we ask for your forgiveness.

16:48.400 --> 16:50.800
Let her correct her ways,
and you can still be a loving couple.

16:52.440 --> 16:54.120
Kangning, that's nonsense.

16:54.200 --> 16:55.560
Shouhua has done nothing wrong!

16:55.640 --> 16:58.680
She's beautiful, gentle, and virtuous,
renowned throughout Luoyang!

16:58.760 --> 17:00.640
If not for observing
mourning rites earlier,

17:00.720 --> 17:02.280
would she have so easily married him?

17:03.160 --> 17:05.840
Well, just because
others call you a third-ranked scholar

17:05.920 --> 17:06.840
doesn't mean I do!

17:07.440 --> 17:10.400
If you push me too far, I'll take your
marriage contract and betrothal gifts,

17:10.480 --> 17:12.160
and we'll see each other at Kaifeng Court.

17:12.240 --> 17:13.800
l accuse you
of climbing the social ladder,

17:13.880 --> 17:15.920
abandoning your wife,
and betraying kindness, unforgivable!

17:16.000 --> 17:17.520
Still dreaming of becoming an official?

17:17.600 --> 17:19.280
Dream on!

17:19.360 --> 17:20.920
Fine, I won't argue with you.

17:21.000 --> 17:22.000
Go get Shouhua here.

17:22.080 --> 17:23.280
Brother-in-law,

17:24.520 --> 17:27.280
Leshan is the wildest
when she's causing trouble.

17:27.360 --> 17:29.320
She doesn't care
how prestigious you are in court

17:29.400 --> 17:31.160
or what rank you'll hold in the future.

17:31.240 --> 17:33.800
Shouhua is so upset, she's fallen ill
and can't get out of bed.

17:33.880 --> 17:36.280
If something truly happens to her, then…

17:37.920 --> 17:39.400
Even though our family is small,

17:39.480 --> 17:42.120
we'll have no choice but to take
this to court to seek justice.

17:42.200 --> 17:44.000
Brother-in-law,
that won't reflect well on you.

17:44.640 --> 17:46.000
Think carefully!

17:46.880 --> 17:48.800
Lingyao, Lingyao!

17:48.880 --> 17:50.080
Sir.

17:51.040 --> 17:53.160
Sir, even I can't
slip away from this mess!

18:03.440 --> 18:07.440
Fuhui,
my marriage with Shouhua isn't harmonious.

18:07.520 --> 18:10.800
The reasons are complicated,
and I'm too ashamed to say them aloud.

18:11.560 --> 18:12.840
Please, ask her yourself.

18:13.440 --> 18:15.280
Who gave her that
embroidered handkerchief,

18:15.360 --> 18:16.960
and who wrote those love poems?

18:17.560 --> 18:20.480
I've asked her directly, but does
she truly have a clear conscience?

18:27.040 --> 18:31.600
Kangning, I may be magnanimous and kind,
but I cannot tolerate dishonesty.

18:31.680 --> 18:33.520
In my family,
we don't accept divided loyalties.

18:34.200 --> 18:36.440
A woman cannot step on two boats.

18:37.120 --> 18:40.720
I cannot comply with your request.
I hope you'll understand.

18:47.560 --> 18:49.320
If Leshan wants to go, let her,

18:49.400 --> 18:54.360
but if you file an accusation in court,
neither family will save face.

18:54.440 --> 18:56.160
Moreover, you risk
being accused of slander.

18:56.240 --> 18:59.040
I fear your frail health
may not endure a few lashes.

19:00.040 --> 19:00.920
You…

19:03.240 --> 19:04.080
- Haode!
- Stop it!

19:06.880 --> 19:08.160
I can't take this anymore.

19:10.320 --> 19:11.480
Mr. Chai!

19:11.560 --> 19:13.120
Mr. Chai!

19:15.920 --> 19:16.760
Yangxi!

19:16.840 --> 19:17.800
- You!
- Go, go, go!

19:17.880 --> 19:18.720
Yangxi!

19:18.800 --> 19:20.520
- Well, don't run so fast!
- Haode!

19:20.600 --> 19:22.120
- Why did you let him get away?
- Yanxi!

19:22.200 --> 19:24.040
- Mother! Mother!
- I didn't let him escape!

19:24.120 --> 19:24.960
Yangxi!

19:26.560 --> 19:27.720
Yangxi!

19:28.760 --> 19:29.880
Yangxi!

19:31.280 --> 19:32.520
Stop running so fast!

19:32.600 --> 19:33.760
Yangxi!

19:35.000 --> 19:36.120
Yangxi!

19:39.240 --> 19:40.400
Yangxi!

19:49.720 --> 19:51.240
Caught you!

19:52.760 --> 19:56.120
Don't worry, Lingyao is clever.
He already led your mother-in-law away.

19:56.200 --> 19:58.240
And you're still
in the mood to joke around?

19:58.320 --> 20:00.520
Those daughters are all formidable.

20:00.600 --> 20:01.960
I barely got away!

20:02.520 --> 20:03.360
It serves you right!

20:03.440 --> 20:06.360
Why on earth are you divorcing your wife

20:06.440 --> 20:08.200
and dragging us into this mess?

20:09.840 --> 20:11.040
My mistake!

20:11.640 --> 20:13.680
I intended to quietly
send her back to her family.

20:13.760 --> 20:15.080
Who knew it'd escalate so quickly?

20:18.120 --> 20:19.160
Mr. Fan,

20:20.240 --> 20:22.320
I fear the Li family won't let this go.

20:22.400 --> 20:24.040
Please, go yourself

20:24.640 --> 20:26.680
to pacify my mother. Tell her…

20:26.760 --> 20:29.120
Tell her I'm at the scholarly assembly
for a few days.

20:29.840 --> 20:31.560
I owe you one. Please, go!

20:36.080 --> 20:38.080
Do you think stirring
a hornet's nest is a good idea?

20:38.640 --> 20:39.800
You're fearless!

20:39.880 --> 20:43.160
Well, he's gone now.

20:43.240 --> 20:45.720
- Time to tell the truth.
- What truth?

20:45.800 --> 20:49.320
I thought you sent
that fool away to talk to me.

20:50.000 --> 20:52.120
It turns out I was overthinking it.
I'm leaving.

20:52.960 --> 20:54.640
Mr. Chai, I was wrong.

20:55.360 --> 20:56.440
I sent him away

20:57.520 --> 20:58.840
because…

20:59.440 --> 21:00.400
I'm an informant!

21:00.480 --> 21:03.800
I knew that Du fellow had ill intentions,
so I planted by his side from the start.

21:03.880 --> 21:06.760
The moment he made a wrong move,
I was ready to report back to my lady.

21:07.360 --> 21:09.120
Among all the Li family's sons-in-law,

21:09.200 --> 21:10.840
they're all pretenders.

21:10.920 --> 21:13.120
Only I am the real deal!

21:21.760 --> 21:23.120
Don't believe me?

21:23.200 --> 21:25.680
He's at the east end
near Sweetwater Alley by Pan Restaurant.

21:27.320 --> 21:28.760
Cousin is there too.

21:28.840 --> 21:31.400
- My husband?
- Kangning, you might not know this yet.

21:31.480 --> 21:34.080
Cousin knows that man plans for divorce,
but refused to let anyone tell you.

21:34.160 --> 21:37.600
He's not just impartial, he's ready to
uphold justice against his own family!

21:38.240 --> 21:39.360
What a heartless man.

21:39.440 --> 21:40.960
Kangning, you should skin him alive.

21:41.040 --> 21:42.440
Enough, enough!

21:42.520 --> 21:43.720
Stop talking so much.

21:43.800 --> 21:45.680
Did Mr. Du say anything else?

21:46.800 --> 21:47.800
No, no,

21:48.640 --> 21:49.480
nothing else.

21:49.560 --> 21:50.600
Then why did you come back?

21:50.680 --> 21:52.480
Go find out more!

21:52.560 --> 21:53.840
Quickly, go!

21:53.920 --> 21:55.040
Fine, fine, I'm going.

21:56.280 --> 21:57.440
Useless!

21:58.000 --> 21:58.840
PAN RESTAURANT

21:58.920 --> 22:00.560
Mr. Chai says he's a fool,

22:00.640 --> 22:02.400
but I don't think so.

22:03.480 --> 22:05.560
This act of playing dumb.

22:05.640 --> 22:07.400
He's probably already sold both of us out.

22:07.480 --> 22:08.560
Expected as much.

22:09.240 --> 22:10.960
Well, I'm also
a son-in-law of the Li family.

22:11.040 --> 22:12.600
Aren't you afraid I'll sell you out too?

22:12.680 --> 22:16.360
A man's knees,
once they bend before a skirt,

22:16.440 --> 22:17.720
there's no hope left for him.

22:17.800 --> 22:20.720
You're known for your righteous

22:20.800 --> 22:22.800
and chivalrous heart.
I trust you completely.

22:23.800 --> 22:25.080
Besides, so far,

22:25.160 --> 22:26.760
you've only bent one knee.

22:26.840 --> 22:28.040
There's still hope, still hope!

22:28.120 --> 22:29.480
Stop teasing me.

22:29.560 --> 22:31.680
Just say what you want.

22:32.480 --> 22:33.960
Mr. Chai, you're truly perceptive.

22:34.040 --> 22:35.960
I have another important matter
to entrust to you.

22:42.120 --> 22:43.600
Madam, blessings upon you.

22:45.080 --> 22:47.160
I brought a maid from the Cao family

22:47.240 --> 22:48.880
to the Du household's door,

22:48.960 --> 22:50.880
only to be rudely turned away.

22:50.960 --> 22:52.480
When I returned a second time,

22:52.560 --> 22:54.560
they simply said Mr. Du wasn't home.

22:55.160 --> 22:56.840
Hearing that you were here,

22:56.920 --> 22:59.080
I came to pay my respects.

22:59.800 --> 23:02.560
Shouhua. Madam is busy
tending to the shop up front.

23:02.640 --> 23:05.600
Before leaving, she specifically
instructed me to guard the house well.

23:05.680 --> 23:06.920
If she knew…

23:07.000 --> 23:08.240
Don't worry, I'll handle it.

23:08.920 --> 23:09.800
Go stand guard.

23:25.880 --> 23:28.360
This person seems suspicious.
Let's hear what she has to say.

23:28.440 --> 23:31.000
I hired a kitchen maid through you,

23:31.080 --> 23:33.360
and the money was paid in full.

23:33.440 --> 23:35.360
You were generous.

23:35.440 --> 23:37.400
Not a penny short on the deposit.

23:37.480 --> 23:39.760
Since I paid the full amount,

23:39.840 --> 23:41.320
why would you conspire to harm me?

23:41.920 --> 23:43.880
I'm innocent! Truly innocent!

23:43.960 --> 23:45.920
I've worked tirelessly all year round,

23:46.000 --> 23:48.480
finding maids
and renting homes for others,

23:48.560 --> 23:50.600
just to barely make ends meet.

23:50.680 --> 23:52.680
How could I dare offend Mr. Du's wife?

23:52.760 --> 23:55.640
Stop playing both sides with me.

23:56.280 --> 23:58.720
Speak the truth, and I may forgive you.

23:59.360 --> 24:00.920
But if you dare fabricate excuses again,

24:01.000 --> 24:02.840
I'll have you bound
and sent to the authorities.

24:02.920 --> 24:05.880
In court, under harsh interrogation,
you'll have no chance to deny it.

24:06.800 --> 24:07.840
Chunlai!

24:08.560 --> 24:10.600
My lady, don't shout, don't shout!

24:14.920 --> 24:18.880
My lady, it wasn't me
conspiring with others against her.

24:18.960 --> 24:22.720
It was her who was heartless,
causing someone else to suffer.

24:24.160 --> 24:25.480
What nonsense are you spouting?

24:25.560 --> 24:30.360
What kind of person is he
to beg me relentlessly?

24:30.440 --> 24:32.600
He only asked me
to deliver an old keepsake.

24:33.200 --> 24:35.880
Seeing such a lovesick fool moved my pity.

24:35.960 --> 24:38.280
She is an upright person.

24:38.360 --> 24:40.920
When I see her, it's like seeing a fairy.

24:41.000 --> 24:42.640
I adore and revere her.

24:42.720 --> 24:44.760
How could I dare relay his words lightly?

24:44.840 --> 24:48.560
Unexpectedly, the handkerchief
ended up in Mr. Du's hands,

24:49.280 --> 24:50.800
causing trouble for her.

24:50.880 --> 24:54.240
So, it was an unintentional mistake.

24:55.200 --> 24:58.880
I don't believe you.
Bring him here to face me.

24:59.560 --> 25:02.760
He regrets implicating her deeply.

25:02.840 --> 25:04.520
If you agree to see him even once,

25:04.600 --> 25:06.280
it'd be like giving him
a new lease on life.

25:06.880 --> 25:12.280
However, your mother is truly formidable,
and she guards the household tightly.

25:12.960 --> 25:18.040
My lady, if your heart is genuine,
why not devise a way to meet him outside?

25:20.200 --> 25:23.840
Clearly, he's a fully capable man,
yet he skulks about like this,

25:24.440 --> 25:26.880
forcing me, a secluded woman,
to venture outside the curtains.

25:28.360 --> 25:30.200
It's not love sickness she has.

25:30.280 --> 25:32.240
More like he's broken
his leg and lost his courage.

25:32.320 --> 25:33.200
Better not to see him.

25:33.920 --> 25:36.720
My lady, don't rush, don't rush!

25:37.440 --> 25:40.320
Look, on the eighth of April,

25:40.400 --> 25:42.280
all the temples hold
the Buddha Bathing Festival.

25:42.360 --> 25:44.960
The Li family will surely
go to pay their respects.

25:45.600 --> 25:49.480
On that day,
find an excuse to stay home alone.

25:49.560 --> 25:51.720
I'll secretly bring him in.

25:51.800 --> 25:53.240
No one will know.

25:53.320 --> 25:57.640
You two can talk inside,
and I'll guard the door.

26:10.280 --> 26:12.720
My lady, you shouldn't
visit the shop these days.

26:12.800 --> 26:14.320
You haven't seen it.

26:14.400 --> 26:16.600
So many people
are all coming to ask Mr. Du

26:16.680 --> 26:18.000
for his calligraphy and paintings.

26:18.080 --> 26:21.480
They bring gold and silver,
flooding the shop with their requests.

26:22.800 --> 26:26.000
It's making Lady Cui
next door green with envy.

26:28.120 --> 26:31.680
Thankfully, the matter of the divorce
hasn't spread yet.

26:33.160 --> 26:34.000
Mother.

26:41.640 --> 26:45.280
Ms. Liu, lately, Shouhua has been uneasy.

26:45.360 --> 26:48.480
I've prepared two pig hearts
in the kitchen.

26:48.560 --> 26:49.640
Go and cook them.

27:04.240 --> 27:06.120
Shouhua, are you really not coming?

27:06.800 --> 27:07.920
Come with us!

27:08.000 --> 27:10.240
The fair outside Xiangguo Temple
for the Buddha Bathing Festival

27:10.320 --> 27:11.560
is lively and bustling!

27:12.160 --> 27:14.280
Alright, alright. Shouhua has a headache.

27:14.360 --> 27:15.800
Let her stay home and rest.

27:15.880 --> 27:18.040
Fuhui, and Kangning
are waiting at Pan Restaurant.

27:18.120 --> 27:20.160
Don't miss the time.

27:20.760 --> 27:24.160
Chunlai,
take good care of Shouhua at home.

27:24.240 --> 27:25.240
Yes.

27:26.360 --> 27:27.200
Mother, take care.

27:31.600 --> 27:32.840
Alright, we're off!

27:55.560 --> 27:57.440
Sir, you're so muddled.

27:57.520 --> 28:00.720
In front of me,
you were as charming as a songbird,

28:00.800 --> 28:02.080
speaking and singing beautifully.

28:03.320 --> 28:06.440
Yet in front of my lady, you fall silent.

28:07.160 --> 28:08.800
Go on and greet her properly!

28:09.840 --> 28:12.920
My lady, I offer you my humble greetings.

28:13.920 --> 28:17.040
Sir. I cannot accept such a greeting.

28:19.840 --> 28:21.600
Don't blame her for being cold-hearted.

28:21.680 --> 28:24.040
That handkerchief caused great trouble.

28:25.400 --> 28:26.880
Who wouldn't be angry?

28:26.960 --> 28:31.480
Pour some wine to apologize,
and then you can talk slowly.

28:43.320 --> 28:46.120
Mother, why leave so soon
after reaching the temple gate?

28:46.200 --> 28:47.200
Did you forget something?

28:47.280 --> 28:49.240
I'll have someone fetch it.

28:49.320 --> 28:50.760
No need for you to go personally.

28:50.840 --> 28:52.280
Exactly!

28:52.360 --> 28:53.760
The festival hasn't even started.

28:53.840 --> 28:57.240
What's so urgent that you must leave
before seeing the excitement?

28:58.200 --> 28:59.440
Leshan!

29:05.840 --> 29:06.680
My lady.

29:09.040 --> 29:10.680
I just want to ask you.

29:11.400 --> 29:14.040
We were strangers,
with no enmity between us.

29:14.120 --> 29:17.120
Why create trouble
that led to my being divorced?

29:17.200 --> 29:19.720
How can you say we were strangers?
My lady, have you forgotten?

29:19.800 --> 29:21.960
Years ago, I came to your door
to ask your hand in marriage.

29:24.240 --> 29:25.240
So, it really was you.

29:27.640 --> 29:28.920
My lady has a good memory.

29:31.120 --> 29:33.600
That year, I saw you
swinging in the courtyard,

29:34.400 --> 29:36.040
and I lost my heart and soul at once.

29:36.120 --> 29:37.800
I begged my parents
to propose on my behalf.

29:37.880 --> 29:39.840
But we were a step too late.

29:39.920 --> 29:41.160
The Wu family got there first.

29:42.320 --> 29:43.560
That match was made,

29:44.160 --> 29:46.360
but my feelings for you remained.

29:46.440 --> 29:47.480
You haunted my dreams.

29:48.080 --> 29:49.720
I thought it was our fate to part forever.

29:49.800 --> 29:52.080
But then that Wu fellow
turned out to have a short life.

29:52.760 --> 29:54.920
Less than two years later,
he left you behind.

29:55.760 --> 29:58.120
At that time,
my family faced a great upheaval,

29:58.200 --> 29:59.760
and she had to observe mourning rites.

30:00.480 --> 30:01.840
I dared not disturb you.

30:03.040 --> 30:05.720
When I inquired again, the Li family
had already moved to the capital.

30:06.320 --> 30:08.200
After much hardship,
I found my way to your door,

30:08.280 --> 30:10.080
but you were already
promised to someone else.

30:10.160 --> 30:12.320
You're truly a devoted man.

30:13.160 --> 30:15.400
Even so, you shouldn't
have ruined my reputation.

30:15.480 --> 30:17.200
I wasn't trying to harm you, my lady.

30:17.880 --> 30:19.200
I was standing up for you.

30:20.440 --> 30:23.280
That Du fellow,
a poor beggar from a humble background,

30:23.360 --> 30:25.880
relying on his smooth tongue
to climb the social ladder,

30:25.960 --> 30:27.840
is nothing but a petty man
from the streets.

30:27.920 --> 30:29.280
How is he worthy of you?

30:29.880 --> 30:32.400
It is I who am unworthy of Mr. Du.

30:33.000 --> 30:35.000
My lady, you only know part of the story.

30:35.640 --> 30:37.360
Some top scholars
who pass the imperial exams

30:37.440 --> 30:38.720
rise to high-ranking positions.

30:39.320 --> 30:41.280
Others remain minor officials for decades.

30:42.120 --> 30:43.560
Do you know which one he is?

30:44.160 --> 30:47.680
I fear your efforts
and sacrifices will all be in vain.

30:48.280 --> 30:50.080
I've married him.

30:50.160 --> 30:52.720
Whatever happens is now up to fate.

30:53.680 --> 30:55.080
My lady, you're being foolish.

30:56.040 --> 30:59.240
As soon as you married him,
he stayed at the scholarly assembly,

30:59.320 --> 31:01.200
drinking, feasting,
and composing poetry daily.

31:01.280 --> 31:02.680
When has he ever thought of you?

31:03.320 --> 31:08.040
It pains me to see you suffer.
That's why I had the middleman test him.

31:08.840 --> 31:10.480
If he truly cared for you,

31:10.560 --> 31:12.640
he wouldn't neglect
and despise his new bride,

31:12.720 --> 31:14.240
letting you endure ridicule.

31:14.840 --> 31:20.280
Nor would he doubt you over a few rumors
and go so far as to divorce you.

31:20.880 --> 31:22.400
He's not reliable.

31:23.000 --> 31:23.960
And you are?

31:27.040 --> 31:32.280
My lady, the Yan family is wealthy,
and I am of noble lineage.

31:32.360 --> 31:33.760
I've also passed the imperial exams.

31:33.840 --> 31:37.200
In terms of talent and appearance,
where do I fall short?

31:37.840 --> 31:40.840
Moreover, my feelings for you are sincere.
Heaven and Earth can attest to that.

31:40.920 --> 31:43.280
My lady, please accept me.

31:43.920 --> 31:46.120
Though what you've done was wrong,

31:46.760 --> 31:48.520
I did it out of love.

31:49.120 --> 31:51.360
Alright then, I'll forgive you a little,
just for now.

31:54.120 --> 31:55.920
It's enough if my lady
is willing to pardon me.

31:57.760 --> 32:00.920
Come, please drink this cup,

32:01.000 --> 32:02.760
and let's put
all past grievances behind us.

32:04.280 --> 32:05.360
Not so fast.

32:06.320 --> 32:08.640
I still have

32:08.720 --> 32:10.200
one thing to clarify.

32:10.280 --> 32:13.960
The handkerchief could've been faked,
but what about the bracelet?

32:15.080 --> 32:17.600
My lady, you wouldn't be
trying to trick me, would you?

32:18.400 --> 32:19.760
He's already set on divorcing me.

32:20.480 --> 32:22.000
What reason do I have to deceive you?

32:22.080 --> 32:26.240
You boast of your sincerity and affection,
but it's all lies, isn't it?

32:26.840 --> 32:30.120
My lady, this matter is not so difficult.

32:30.200 --> 32:33.120
The items you usually favor
are all listed at the jewelry shop.

32:33.720 --> 32:36.040
Money can loosen any tongue.

32:36.120 --> 32:37.840
When I saw that Du fellow
move into the court

32:37.920 --> 32:39.680
the day after his wedding,

32:40.320 --> 32:41.960
I suspected there was discord between you.

32:42.040 --> 32:43.280
So, I decided to test him.

32:44.240 --> 32:46.200
That so-called brilliant Mr. Du

32:46.880 --> 32:48.560
is nothing more than a gullible fool.

32:49.560 --> 32:51.360
So, that's how it is.

32:52.960 --> 32:53.800
My lady, please!

32:59.160 --> 33:01.920
There's no use blaming you now.

33:02.520 --> 33:05.080
He's determined
to divorce me no matter what.

33:06.160 --> 33:09.120
So, when will you come to marry me?

33:09.720 --> 33:11.120
I can't stand this.

33:12.480 --> 33:16.600
Fuhui, Kangning, and Qiongnu,
the three of you, go capture him!

33:17.200 --> 33:19.560
Mother, Shouhua isn't like that.

33:19.640 --> 33:20.720
Don't embarrass her.

33:20.800 --> 33:23.880
That's why I told you to see for yourself.

33:25.360 --> 33:26.200
Hurry up.

33:28.560 --> 33:29.800
If one of them got away,

33:29.880 --> 33:31.320
that leaves you to answer for it.

33:39.440 --> 33:40.600
Sit down.

33:47.360 --> 33:48.440
What are you doing here?

33:49.120 --> 33:50.720
My lady, he's inside now.

33:50.800 --> 33:52.920
Did he really go in!

33:57.320 --> 33:59.400
Chunlai, we're back!

33:59.480 --> 34:00.840
Chunlai!

34:00.920 --> 34:01.800
Chunlai, let us in!

34:01.880 --> 34:04.240
It's me! Hurry and open the door!

34:05.600 --> 34:07.640
Chunlai, open up! Let us in!

34:07.720 --> 34:08.560
You two stay here.

34:08.640 --> 34:10.120
- No one goes in or out.
- Understood.

34:10.720 --> 34:13.440
Chunlai, Chunlai!

34:14.360 --> 34:18.200
What? You're already married?
Then why come here and ruin lives?

34:18.280 --> 34:20.840
That marriage
was forced on me by my father.

34:20.920 --> 34:22.040
I wasn't willing.

34:22.640 --> 34:24.240
She's just someone to stay at home.

34:24.320 --> 34:26.600
Once I'm assigned a post,
I'll take you with me.

34:27.200 --> 34:30.000
In faraway lands, you'll be my wife.

34:30.600 --> 34:31.760
My lady!

34:34.000 --> 34:35.080
Shameless!

34:37.200 --> 34:38.680
He's determined to divorce you anyway.

34:38.760 --> 34:40.600
Why not come with me instead?

34:40.680 --> 34:42.360
It's better than enduring scorn
from others.

34:46.720 --> 34:50.040
You've always belonged to me.
Where else could you run?

34:53.120 --> 34:54.640
Slow down! Slow down!

34:54.720 --> 34:56.800
My lady, you're pregnant.
Please be careful.

34:56.880 --> 34:58.000
- Kangning!
- I'm fine.

34:58.080 --> 34:59.520
- You're getting in the way.
- Fuhui, I…

35:00.040 --> 35:01.000
I…

35:04.760 --> 35:06.000
My lady!

35:06.080 --> 35:07.040
My lady!

35:09.120 --> 35:11.560
If I'm unworthy, are you worthy then?

35:11.640 --> 35:14.280
You're worse than a beast
in human clothing!

35:19.440 --> 35:20.480
Tie him up!

35:22.120 --> 35:23.080
You can't do this!

35:23.160 --> 35:24.640
I have scholarly honors!

35:24.720 --> 35:26.920
And yet you know nothing
of propriety, honor, and shame.

35:27.000 --> 35:28.440
How dare you claim to be a scholar?

35:28.520 --> 35:30.640
You've disgraced all learned men.

35:34.720 --> 35:35.760
My lady!

35:36.560 --> 35:39.000
It's too small here. Let's take him
to the main hall for questioning.

35:41.760 --> 35:45.400
Mr. Yan gave me five strings of coins

35:45.480 --> 35:49.000
and promised a bigger reward
once the task was done.

35:49.840 --> 35:51.080
Greedy for money,

35:51.160 --> 35:53.360
I agreed to deliver his message.

35:55.280 --> 35:59.960
I shouldn't have helped
someone seduce Mr. Du's wife.

36:01.120 --> 36:04.240
But my lady's character is so upright.

36:04.320 --> 36:06.120
Nothing could entice her.

36:06.200 --> 36:07.320
When he couldn't have her,

36:07.400 --> 36:09.280
he resorted to this vile scheme.

36:09.360 --> 36:11.440
He spread baseless rumors

36:11.520 --> 36:14.080
to incite Mr. Du to divorce her.

36:14.960 --> 36:18.640
I warned him, doing such a heartless thing

36:18.720 --> 36:20.440
would bring retribution.

36:23.520 --> 36:25.000
He's truly ruthless.

36:26.520 --> 36:28.200
And you're trying
to wash your hands of it?

36:31.120 --> 36:31.960
What's this?

36:33.920 --> 36:36.520
Master Chai, have mercy!

36:36.600 --> 36:39.800
He forced me! It was all him!

36:39.880 --> 36:41.360
When you couldn't seduce Shouhua,

36:41.440 --> 36:43.240
you resorted to drugging
this wine in advance.

36:43.320 --> 36:44.920
You planned to knock her unconscious

36:45.000 --> 36:48.600
and carry her away in a sedan chair,
vanishing without a trace.

36:49.280 --> 36:50.720
Then, you'd spread the word

36:50.800 --> 36:53.800
that Shouhua eloped
with someone and vanished.

36:53.880 --> 36:56.840
Mr. Du would be enraged
but unable to make it public,

36:56.920 --> 36:58.440
swallowing his anger in silence.

36:58.520 --> 37:01.200
The Li family would be too ashamed

37:01.280 --> 37:03.240
to investigate further.

37:03.320 --> 37:05.400
- Is this true or not?
- It's true! It's all true!

37:05.480 --> 37:06.880
Master Chai, you're brilliant.

37:06.960 --> 37:08.160
I deserve to die!

37:08.240 --> 37:11.400
I couldn't recognize a true man!

37:13.840 --> 37:16.680
You! You! You all!

37:16.760 --> 37:18.520
It wasn't that we wanted
to hide it from you.

37:18.600 --> 37:21.920
We were afraid the news would leak,
and the fish wouldn't take the bait.

37:25.880 --> 37:29.120
If he'd really carried her off,
it would've been hopeless.

37:29.760 --> 37:31.320
You'd never see her again in this life.

37:31.400 --> 37:32.440
So terrifying!

37:32.520 --> 37:36.200
Pah. So malicious! We should expose him.

37:36.280 --> 37:38.680
Let the whole city know his lies,

37:38.760 --> 37:41.240
so no other women
fall victim to him in the future.

37:47.600 --> 37:50.080
And when did Mr. Du start suspecting me?

37:52.200 --> 37:55.040
From our first meeting!
You were overly eager and attentive.

37:55.640 --> 37:59.440
We had barely met,
yet you spoke deeply and personally.

38:00.040 --> 38:01.280
That made me more suspicious.

38:01.880 --> 38:05.040
And those nonsense stories
of yours are full of holes.

38:05.960 --> 38:07.200
If you truly loved her,

38:07.280 --> 38:11.000
why didn't you openly propose for her hand
and become a proper couple,

38:11.840 --> 38:13.200
instead speaking of secret love?

38:13.280 --> 38:14.760
Didn't you know
you were harmful to her?

38:15.360 --> 38:18.160
You speak up for justice in public
but defy propriety in private.

38:18.240 --> 38:21.360
Your words and actions
contradict each other.

38:21.440 --> 38:22.680
How am I supposed to trust you?

38:22.760 --> 38:25.280
So, that day…

38:26.000 --> 38:27.720
That day, you were all in the house?

38:52.040 --> 38:54.200
The Li family has gone too far
in pushing me.

38:54.280 --> 38:55.840
This is intolerable!

38:56.520 --> 38:58.760
Today, I will divorce my wife!

38:59.760 --> 39:00.600
Cry, cry!

39:05.640 --> 39:06.480
Go ahead and cry!

39:08.960 --> 39:12.640
I should thank my wife
for helping me complete the act with me,

39:12.720 --> 39:14.840
so I could catch you,
the mastermind, red-handed.

39:15.720 --> 39:17.200
Shouhua, did you hear that?

39:17.280 --> 39:19.400
This is the wonderful
son-in-law you've chosen.

39:19.480 --> 39:22.400
So calculating, he'll end up harming
your daughter sooner or later.

39:22.480 --> 39:24.480
Shouhua, did you hear that?

39:24.560 --> 39:26.000
- Guards!
- Shouhua!

39:26.080 --> 39:26.920
Gag him!

39:27.000 --> 39:28.520
Even now, he won't stop sowing discord.

39:28.600 --> 39:29.560
Drag him out!

39:36.960 --> 39:37.800
- Yes!
- Madam!

39:37.880 --> 39:39.200
- Mother.
- Mother.

39:39.280 --> 39:40.520
Alright, alright.

39:41.120 --> 39:43.200
I heard everything outside.

39:43.920 --> 39:45.760
Truly a good son-in-law.

39:45.840 --> 39:47.160
What talent!

39:47.240 --> 39:49.480
So, you've already caught the schemer?

39:49.560 --> 39:53.560
Good. Catching him brings peace of mind.

39:55.720 --> 39:57.040
Madam,

39:57.120 --> 39:58.920
- we must also thank Mr. Chai this time.
- Fuhui.

40:01.840 --> 40:04.200
Another good son-in-law of mine.

40:04.280 --> 40:06.680
Chunlai, tell Madam Liu
to prepare a feast.

40:06.760 --> 40:08.600
Let's celebrate properly.

40:09.480 --> 40:10.640
Yes.

40:10.720 --> 40:12.120
Don't celebrate too soon.

40:13.040 --> 40:14.800
They haven't been sent
to the authorities yet.

40:19.200 --> 40:20.960
Of course,
they'll be sent to the authorities,

40:21.440 --> 40:23.600
but first, we need to consult you.

40:24.720 --> 40:27.120
Why consult?
They should be punished severely!

40:33.000 --> 40:34.560
That's tricky.

40:35.080 --> 40:36.280
The middleman should be

40:36.360 --> 40:39.000
banished from the capital,
never allowed to return.

40:39.080 --> 40:40.240
As for that Yan fellow,

40:40.840 --> 40:43.840
a severe beating
as a small warning will suffice.

40:43.920 --> 40:47.280
Such a scoundrel. Why not arrest him
straight away? Instead, you let him off?

40:47.360 --> 40:49.080
That's also Mother's opinion.

40:49.160 --> 40:51.200
Bringing this to court would
require full disclosure.

40:51.280 --> 40:53.480
He holds scholarly honors,
so detaining him wouldn't be proper.

40:54.080 --> 40:55.440
If he denies everything,

40:55.520 --> 40:58.920
we'd need witnesses to testify by law,
and Shouhua would have to appear in court.

40:59.520 --> 41:02.760
If Mr. Du's wife goes to court,
it'll cause a huge scandal.

41:02.840 --> 41:04.200
Would that benefit her?

41:04.800 --> 41:07.080
And if that scoundrel
spouts more nonsense,

41:07.160 --> 41:08.640
it would be utterly disgraceful.

41:09.600 --> 41:11.040
That would truly let him off lightly.

41:11.840 --> 41:14.360
Don't worry! Big brother-in-law
isn't easy to deal with.

41:14.440 --> 41:20.040
He may seem like a frail scholar,
but he's resourceful and composed.

41:20.120 --> 41:21.920
Earlier, didn't he fool all of us?

41:22.000 --> 41:23.800
We really thought
he was going to divorce her!

41:24.560 --> 41:26.640
Shouhua, are you unhappy?

41:29.120 --> 41:32.560
You're talking nonsense again.
Shouhua isn't unhappy.

41:32.640 --> 41:35.080
Her husband is far cleverer than mine.

41:35.680 --> 41:38.200
This afternoon,
look at how ridiculous Fan Lianghan was!

41:40.720 --> 41:42.640
You, you…

41:44.320 --> 41:45.680
- But…
- Haode!

41:47.400 --> 41:48.240
Some seeds!

42:14.400 --> 42:18.480
Leshan, it's late.
Go check if the feast has ended.

42:19.200 --> 42:20.240
Alright.

42:21.720 --> 42:23.720
Fuhui, Fuhui!

42:23.800 --> 42:24.640
Go quickly!

42:24.720 --> 42:26.560
It looks like
your husband got into a fight!

42:26.640 --> 42:27.680
What?

42:28.760 --> 42:29.840
Let's go!

42:29.920 --> 42:30.960
Hey.

42:31.640 --> 42:33.200
This isn't a spectacle for you to watch.

42:33.280 --> 42:34.280
Go play elsewhere!

42:37.640 --> 42:38.480
She's…

42:39.120 --> 42:41.560
- Go play elsewhere!
- I'm not eating.

42:41.640 --> 42:44.920
Brother Fan, we agreed to form
an alliance as sons-in-law.

42:45.640 --> 42:47.760
Yet you turned around
and reported us to your wife!

42:47.840 --> 42:50.000
Weren't you the one
who sold me and Brother Chai out?

42:50.080 --> 42:52.480
You weren't afraid when you tattled.
Now you're scared?

42:52.560 --> 42:53.800
Fan Lianghan, come out!

42:53.880 --> 42:55.760
I won't hit you. Just come out!

42:55.840 --> 42:57.920
I won't! I'm not coming out!

42:58.000 --> 42:59.720
Many men fear their wives,

42:59.800 --> 43:03.000
but your level of fear is one of a kind.

43:03.080 --> 43:05.040
What's wrong with fearing one's wife?

43:05.120 --> 43:08.480
Fearing one's wife is a tradition of
Chinese men, passed down for generations!

43:08.560 --> 43:09.920
It's not fear.

43:10.000 --> 43:11.680
It's respect and love.

43:11.760 --> 43:15.120
Those who mock it,
do they have beautiful, virtuous wives?

43:15.200 --> 43:17.640
They're just jealous, petty people!

43:18.720 --> 43:21.320
- My lady! My lady, save me!
- Come out.

43:21.400 --> 43:22.240
Get up.

43:22.320 --> 43:23.240
- My lady!
- What's wrong?

43:23.320 --> 43:25.600
My lady, save me! Save me!

43:26.640 --> 43:28.440
- What's going on?
- They…

43:28.520 --> 43:30.640
- He…
- We were drinking with him,

43:30.720 --> 43:32.040
and to avoid more drinks,

43:32.120 --> 43:33.360
he crawled under the table.

43:33.440 --> 43:35.120
- Yes, yes!
- Just joking around.

43:35.200 --> 43:36.680
- No!
- Just joking!

43:43.600 --> 43:46.200
I had a bit too much myself,
feeling a little unsteady.

43:46.960 --> 43:47.960
I'll sit down for a while.

43:50.600 --> 43:52.200
Big brother-in-law, don't drink too much!

43:52.280 --> 43:54.320
Shouhua has already had a fright today.

43:54.400 --> 43:56.200
When you take her back,
be sure to comfort her.

43:57.520 --> 44:00.000
Yes, it's late.

44:00.080 --> 44:01.680
We should head home.

44:02.560 --> 44:04.040
The feast ends now.

44:05.560 --> 44:06.680
Thank Fuhui for your concern.

44:08.000 --> 44:09.640
Thank Kangning for the reminder.

44:12.440 --> 44:14.040
Oh, the kidney dish!

44:14.760 --> 44:17.040
My lychee kidney stir-fry
is just off the stove,

44:17.120 --> 44:18.320
and you're leaving already?

44:18.400 --> 44:22.160
Mother, big brother-in-law
should take Shouhua back early.

44:24.200 --> 44:26.960
Alright! Hurry and fetch her.

44:27.040 --> 44:29.760
- Alright, I'll go right away.
- No need!

44:29.840 --> 44:31.240
I'll go myself.

44:40.480 --> 44:43.480
Have one last drink.

45:11.520 --> 45:12.680
Dear.

45:19.320 --> 45:21.640
Sir, there are no blankets
in the carriage.

45:21.720 --> 45:23.160
Don't fall asleep,

45:24.040 --> 45:27.720
or should I help sober you up?

45:29.800 --> 45:31.600
Am I not pressing hard enough?

45:31.680 --> 45:32.960
Murdering your husband?

45:36.520 --> 45:38.040
- Awake?
- I'm awake, I'm awake!

45:38.120 --> 45:40.240
My lady commands.
I wouldn't dare stay asleep.

45:40.320 --> 45:42.560
Why are you scheming behind my back?

45:43.280 --> 45:45.520
You secretly helped
Mr. Du catch the schemer.

45:45.600 --> 45:46.920
Did you inform me beforehand?

45:47.000 --> 45:48.360
My lady, how unfair!

45:48.440 --> 45:50.920
The couple decided together
to set a trap and catch the thief.

45:51.000 --> 45:53.240
I helped out of kindness.
How is that a crime?

45:53.840 --> 45:57.160
If Shouhua had agreed to the plan,
she would've proven her innocence.

45:57.240 --> 46:01.000
If she hesitated,
it would've confirmed her guilt.

46:02.320 --> 46:03.760
What a clever move by Du Yangxi.

46:03.840 --> 46:07.600
He pretended to target Yan Zimei,
but in reality, he was testing Shouhua.

46:08.280 --> 46:10.520
They've been married only a few days.

46:11.320 --> 46:13.720
Not knowing each other
before the wedding is normal.

46:13.800 --> 46:15.320
A groom having doubts isn't surprising.

46:16.000 --> 46:19.000
Besides, if not for Yan's villainy,

46:19.080 --> 46:21.200
how would Shouhua's
spotless reputation be revealed?

46:21.840 --> 46:25.240
After this, he should have no doubts left.

46:25.320 --> 46:26.520
And you, my lady,

46:27.960 --> 46:31.160
don't be angry with him.

46:31.240 --> 46:36.920
After all, couples like us,
without suspicion and full of affection,

46:37.000 --> 46:38.520
are rare indeed.

46:40.000 --> 46:41.240
Stop the carriage!

46:42.360 --> 46:43.520
My lady!

46:43.600 --> 46:44.960
I'm not angry with him.

46:45.040 --> 46:46.760
I'm angry with you!

46:47.360 --> 46:50.960
You're loyal to Mr. Du.
But I was so upset the whole time.

46:51.040 --> 46:52.840
No, my lady, let me explain.

46:52.920 --> 46:53.800
- Mr. Du. He--
- Get out!

46:53.880 --> 46:55.440
- It was Shouhua!
- Out, out, out!

46:55.520 --> 46:56.600
- Get out quickly!
- It's them.

46:56.680 --> 46:58.080
My lady! My lady!

46:58.840 --> 46:59.680
My lady!

47:00.360 --> 47:01.440
My lady!

47:02.040 --> 47:03.360
I was wrong, my lady!

47:04.200 --> 47:05.560
What are you laughing at?

47:05.640 --> 47:07.440
My lady, my lady!

47:12.360 --> 47:15.040
My lady, I know I was wrong! My lady!

47:16.320 --> 47:19.720
My lady, how heartless you are,
leaving me stranded halfway!

47:19.800 --> 47:21.240
My lady!

49:50.480 --> 49:53.120
Subtitle translation by: Yuke Ran
